s:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/we-are-excel-experts-1-300x188.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/we-are-excel-experts-1-768x480.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Excel Experts \u2013 A step above the rest<\/h1>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">With over<br>300 happy customers in the past 12 years \u2013 discover the Excel Experts<br>difference<\/h2>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>The Excel Experts was born from the idea of a full spectrum of Excel and general data solutions to be provided to customers throughout the UK and beyond. The Excel Experts team saw an increase in frustrated and confused individuals and companies struggling to comprehend the complexities of their data. We knew that we could push the boundaries and facilitate customers worldwide through the use of advanced training and skilled consultants.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our team of expert consultants will be here to give ongoing support and help when needed. We can help you solve potential usage problems such as users accidentally deleting important data, entering incorrect formats and showing sensitive data to all users along with many other major Excel issues. <\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our full spectrum of services include:&nbsp; Excel and PowerBI consultancy, Excel Macros, Excel-2-web, Microsoft training along with Excel\/PowerBI support and so much more. The full listing can be found <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-services\/\">here<\/a>. When others say no &#8211; we say yes by finding a solution unique to every scenario. With hundreds of satisfied customers in the past two years we are sure to have the solution for your business today. <\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Going for growth <\/h2>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Originally a freelance Excel expert for over 10 years I saw a need for an Excel data agency that offered a comprehensive suite of Excel and more general data solutions. I would pursue any creative avenue possible to achieve his vision and thus The Excel Experts was born. We began initially with the brand \u2018\u2019ExcelFrome\u2019\u2019 a company name dedicated to our locality, but as the brand began to grow with clientele up and down the length and breadth of the UK the name \u2018\u2019The Excel Experts\u2019\u2019 was a better fit with the brands nationwide customers. <\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Excel Experts difference <\/h2>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pushing the boundaries and<br>\ninnovating within the Excel industry was always on our minds. Our team of<br>\nexperts work remotely from virtual offices only opting for physical offices<br>\nwhen required. This unique offering passes on valuable savings to our clients, we<br>\nunderstand that every customers needs are different and our flexible team are<br>\nhere to curate a plan that caters to your specific requirements. <\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The extensive world of Excel<br>\ncan seem overwhelming for some, our consultants have a broad range of expertise<br>\n&amp; knowledge ranging throughout Excel and other skillsets that will reduce<br>\nthe stress and increase the productivity within your business. We will match<br>\nyour requirements according to the consultant with the most expertise in that<br>\narea including: Excel Databases, Finance expertise, Marketing, Microsoft office<br>\nskills etc. With over 20 consultants throughout the UK ranging from a multitude<br>\nof backgrounds and expertise in sciences, business, training and marketing we<br>\nare certain to find your perfect match. <\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The forward thinking Excel Experts &nbsp;<\/h2>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We understand there is a full<br>\narray of different Excel solutions you require for your business. Our team can<br>\nwork remotely to achieve the tasks you require. The process is simple, you can<br>\nsend us the files securely and we will send them back with the work completed. Should<br>\nyou be unable to send files we also have a team of experts who can access your<br>\ncomputer to complete the tasks remotely. Whether you\u2019re in Brooklyn or Bromley<br>\nwe have a product\/service to suit your requirements and budget. We can also<br>\nprovide site visits to your own offices including staff training and one to one<br>\nsessions. <\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your first consultation is always<br>\nfree; during this consultation we will scope the requirements of each<br>\nindividual case and generate a quote to fit your specific budget. Our quality<br>\nwork is offered on either an hourly rate or a fixed quote dependant on the<br>\nproject and your requests. <\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Total satisfaction <\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With hundreds of satisfied<br>\ncustomers, we are confident that we can help with your needs. The Excel Experts<br>\nwill not invoice you until you are totally satisfied\/delighted with your<br>\nproject. So whether your project is building an entire system or just<br>\nupdating\/changing existing systems we have the knowledge and expertise ready to<br>\nhelp you today. <\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our customer base receives<br>\nongoing support from our team. Start your journey by contacting our team of<br>\nExcel Experts today. &nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What We&#8217;re trying to Achieve<\/h2>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Excel Experts<\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Frome is a great little town resting in the Mendip Hills, and it\u2019s where I (Ben) live. &nbsp;Its a thriving place with loads of businesses small and not so small. &nbsp;The idea of ExcelFrome was to think small \u2013 offering Excel expertise to the community whether it be locally in Frome, or nearby in Bristol, Bath and the surrounding areas.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gradually, I was approached by other talented individuals who had huge expertise in Excel, and the idea of running an &nbsp;Excel agency started to take root.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There are other agencies, the challenge was to do something different. I hope you agree we have managed to do that.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Caring For Our Customers<\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Customers:&nbsp;Our client relationship is important to us, we want to make you happy! At \u2018The Excel Experts\u2019 we strive to provide the best possible customer care and satisfaction. We will only invoice once our clients are 100% satisfied with the services. We will also provide after-sales service and support for as long as it is needed. We promise to always respond to any questions or queries you have within 24 hours.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Caring for The Environment<\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We will do everything we can to limit our carbon footprint. This means using video conferencing whenever possible to reduce the need for cars, to save CO2 emissions. We also use environmentally-friendly computers and laptops.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What We Think You Want<\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><p><\/p>\n<li>You want a pair of trustworthy hands or a safe place for a tricky software development problem.<\/li>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<li>When you call us you talk to the boss and the developers themselves not a call centre.<\/li>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<li>Excel is an untapped goldmine for many businesses. A potential powerhouse sitting on your desktop.<\/li>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<li>You are looking for someone who will CARE about your business. Someone who will help you meet your software challenges.<\/li>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<li>You want a team of experienced developers\/consultants to join your team. With many years of combined experience at solving analytical problems with Microsoft Office. Also with direct experience in many different areas of business.<\/li>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<li>You want help to create a clear brief, finished to a clear deadline. The whole project transparent and crystal clear.<\/li>\n<p><\/p><\/ul>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>For further help in understanding Excel please call or contact me.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Thank You for reading<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ben<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-cyan-bluish-gray-background-color has-background is-style-wide\">\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-background is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"background-color:#04b43e\"><p><\/p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-white-color has-text-color\"><strong>NEED HELP WITH AN EXCEL PROJECT, BIG OR SMALL? <\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\">The Excel Experts can help you or your business complete an unfinished project, integrate web applications, automate tasks, and much more.<\/p>\n<p><\/p><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><p><\/p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"772\" height=\"1024\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/image.png\" alt=\"image\" class=\"wp-image-30770 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 772px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 772\/1024;width:96px;height:127px\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/image.png 772w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/image-226x300.png 226w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/image-768x1019.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 772px) 100vw, 772px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure>\n<p><\/p><\/div>\n<p><\/p><\/div>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><p><\/p>\n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f30767-o1\" lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\" data-wpcf7-id=\"30767\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\">\n<p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">\n<ul><\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<form action=\"\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/536#wpcf7-f30767-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form init\" aria-label=\"Contact form\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<fieldset class=\"hidden-fields-container\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"30767\" \/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"6.1.7\" \/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en_GB\" \/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f30767-o1\" \/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" \/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\